  "description": "Seo-Ha is a secretary who has long harbored unrequited feelings for her boss, Do-Hyun. One night, the two are drawn together by raw, instinctive desire and cross the forbidden line. When Seo-Ha suggests that it should just be a one-night stand, Do-Hyun tells her he likes how “clean” their relationship is—and continues to find excuses to see her again. Unable to refuse him, she finds herself pulled deeper into the situation. Then one day, Seo-Ha finds out she's pregnant—an unwanted surprise. Determined to raise the child on her own, she makes the decision to escape… only for Dohyun to learn the truth.",
